{"id":"ce_re_ale","lemma":"céréale","pos":"noun","rank":3476,"glosses":["cereal (plant)","cereal (seed)","cereal (food product made from cereal plants)"],"ipa":"/se.ʁe.al/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/04/Fr-c%C3%A9r%C3%A9ale.ogg/Fr-c%C3%A9r%C3%A9ale.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"céréales"},"formAudio":{"céréales":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/17/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Eihel-c%C3%A9r%C3%A9ales.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Je ne veux pas de céréales.","en":"I don't want cereal.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to want, wish, desire","l":"vouloir"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Je mange des céréales au petit-déjeuner.","en":"I eat cereal for breakfast.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to eat","l":"manger"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null,{"g":"to the"},null,null],"phrases":[[5,7,"breakfast"]]},{"text":"Tom préfère les céréales complètes.","en":"Tom prefers whole-grain cereals.","words":[null,{"g":"to prefer","l":"préférer"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null,{"g":"to complete","l":"compléter"}]},{"text":"Je prendrai bien des céréales et du jus d'orange.","en":"I'll have some cereal and orange juice.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to take","l":"prendre"},{"g":"well"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null,{"g":"and"},{"g":"of the / some"},{"g":"juice"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"orange"}]},{"text":"Tom a versé du lait sur ses céréales.","en":"Tom poured milk on his cereal.","words":[null,{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"versed"},{"g":"of the / some"},{"g":"milk"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"his"},null]}]}